{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01DYgYrW9YJ1LzTDVXH9vDh4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C2ar3fQMcmxv5toPMQR8Ye","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n- E1: also fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` from `cast_spell_free` — casting without paying is still casting (rule 601); copies via `copy_spell` still never fire it.\n- sos_1: with exactly one legal graveyard target the trigger auto-selects and casts it (TODO's parenthetical); declining is only possible via `choose_card`→`None` when there are 2+ candidates.\n- sos_1/sos_120: \"exile instead of graveyard\" for resolving spells needed a small additive seam — `SpellPutIntoGraveyardReplacementEvent` fired by `_resolve_spell`, and `move_to_zone` now consults replacements for stack→graveyard moves too (battlefield behaviour unchanged).\n- AttacksTriggeredEvent was defined but never fired; now fired per declared attacker in `declare_attackers_step` (needed by sos_1; 18 FDN cards already register it).\n- sos_57: \"your next main phase\" implemented as your next *precombat* main (E2 only fires there; postcombat main has no event) — deliberate simplification per TODO. Wizard check happens when the delayed trigger resolves.\n- sos_120: an uncast Paradigm copy is simply not created (rules-wise it would cease to exist immediately); resolved copies are pulled from the stack zone via a prevented replacement so they vanish per 707.10a.\n- sos_13: engine fires ETB events before registering the entering card's triggers (deliberate ordering), so self-\"when this enters\" can't use the event — the card pushes its ETB ability onto the stack from register_triggers (only invoked on entry). Prepared copy is cast via `cast_spell_free` (engine has no pay-cost-from-exile pipeline); rulebook 722.3c would charge {W} — deliberate limitation per TODO.\nEOF\nsed -i 's/^- \\[ \\] \\*\\*sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce \\/\\/ Swords to Plowshares\\*\\*/- [x] **sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce \\/\\/ Swords to Plowshares**/' TODO.md && grep -n \"sos_13\" TODO.md | head -2 && git add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_13: Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\"","description":"Log decisions, mark sos_13, commit"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":887,"cache_read_input_tokens":254635,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":887},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35d9a150-b7c5-4977-937b-f1cc9a0f0ea7","uuid":"7bdf3d06-d3ff-442b-9a99-d20a8665e270","request_id":"req_011CbuCM9o7G7WBM36uXjtH5"}
