{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01A1Y3Swv21y7Pr1zej3nTq8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All checklist work is complete. The full suite passes: **1229 tests** (1145 engine regression + 39 FDN reference + 45 new SOS card tests), with one commit per item.\n\n## What was done\n\n**Scope correction (logged in KEY_DECISIONS.md):** TODO.md lists ten cards, but `run_manifest.json`'s `card_filter` and `prompt.md` scope this run to seven — sos_226/245/257 have no directory or `card_spec.json`, so they're marked out-of-scope in TODO.md rather than invented.\n\n**Shared engine changes (E1–E3, all additive):**\n- **E1** — `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from `cast_spell` *and* `cast_spell_free` (free casts are still casts; copies via `copy_spell` correctly never fire it). Also records `card.mana_spent` for \"mana spent to cast\" effects.\n- **E2** — new `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent`, fired from `GameState.advance_phase` after `empty_mana_pools()`.\n- **E3** — `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents for instants/sorceries.\n\n**Additional small engine seams, each driven by a real card need:** `AttacksTriggeredEvent` now actually fires in `declare_attackers_step` (it was defined but never fired — sos_1 needs it); a `SpellPutIntoGraveyardReplacementEvent` lets replacements redirect resolving spells stack→graveyard (\"exile it instead\" for sos_1/sos_120); `cards_drawn_this_turn` resets at turn wrap (sos_201's miracle gate); `game.rng`, `player.skip_turns`, and skip-aware next-player selection (sos_97's ultimate); and `activate_loyalty_ability_by_index` bridges printed loyalty abilities into the real activation pipeline with targets exposed via `chosen_targets`.\n\n**The seven cards**, each with 5–8 tests through the real engine plus an independent throwaway smoke check: sos_4 (Converge), sos_1 (cost reduction + attack-trigger free cast + e